        "statement": "We believe that we are well positioned in the wholesale domain registration and email markets due in part to our highly-recognized “Tucows”, “OpenSRS”, “Ascio” and “Enom” brands and the respect they confer on us as a defender of end-user rights and reseller-friendly approaches to doing business.",
